# Test assertion set: the two directions of GFO's occupation declarations.
# gfo-base declares occupies (Presential -> Space) functional and its
# inverse occupied_by inverse-functional -- the same constraint twice.
#
# Co-location: two presentials occupy one space entity.
# Multilocation: one presential occupies two space entities.
@prefix gfob: <https://w3id.org/gfo/base/> .
@prefix p:    <https://example.org/mt-probe#> .

# co-location (must remain consistent, no identification)
p:p1 a gfob:Presential ; gfob:occupies p:s .
p:p2 a gfob:Presential ; gfob:occupies p:s .

# multilocation (the spaces must be identified)
p:q a gfob:Presential ; gfob:occupies p:s1 , p:s2 .
